API Automation Testing is the process of programmatically validating APIs (Application Programming Interfaces) to ensure:

    Correct responses

    Proper status codes

    Accurate data

    Secure authentication

    Reliable error handling

    Performance under load (advanced)

Unlike UI automation, API tests are:

    ⚡ Faster

    🔐 More stable

    🧠 Closer to backend logic

    💰 Cheaper to maintain

